WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.940
<i>I, Takato Saijo, the extremely popular actor,</i>

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>have had nurses swoon over me
from the moment I was born into this world.</i>

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:13.740
<i>In kindergarten, the teacher
and all the girls worshipped me as a prince.</i>

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:19.330
<i>Throughout school, girls would line up on
Valentine's Day to present me with chocolate.</i>

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.660
My heart skips a beat
at every iteration of you, Mr. Saijo.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.460
You must have been very popular as a child.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.330
Oh, no, I wouldn't say that.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.630
<i>Of course I was popular.</i>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:30.750
Not particularly.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.300
Oh, come on. I can't believe that!

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.340
After all, you were the Sexiest Man Alive
for five years straight!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Past tense.</i>

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.310
This is your grandmother, Suzuko Saijo, right?

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.730
I understand she was
the marquee player of a small theater.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.360
Was she an influence on you?

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.650
Yes, certainly.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:55.780
When I was eight, I saw a dramatic reading
with her, which kindled my interest for acting.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.870
When I told her I wanted
to try that someday, she said...

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.830
That someday...

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.580
is now.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.370
I'm grateful to my grandmother.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.040
Thanks to her, I am who I am today.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:14.050
<i>And entering the entertainment world
made me more popular than ever.</i>

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.550
<i>I really like you, even if you hate me.</i>

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:22.180
<i>Who said that to me again?</i>

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.990
hug9 "...I guess you two are close."

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.110
Long time no see, Boss.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.150
Oh, has it been that long?

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.410
I see you every day on TV and in magazines.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.330
I'm kept busy, thanks to you.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.580
Nitto Talent Agency
President
Kinue Hanabusa

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.500
This is from the sponsor
of the commercial you shot in Hawaii.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.250
It's appreciation for helping him
create a great commercial.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.750
I'm touched.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:17.840
I love the wine, but I'm
especially pleased that he was happy.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.470
You never change.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:26.350
You've had the face of a professional
ever since you were a kid.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.100
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.520
I want to make the former president proud,
since he scouted me first.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.560
I think you've made him plenty proud.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.530
Takato Saijo's
Manager
Takumi Sasaki

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.280
Right now you're the cash cow for Nitto Talent.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:43.240
Takato, once in a while,
you should allow yourself to spread your wings.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.080
I agree with that.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.290
Work would still come in either way.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.750
So I think you could
take a break and spread your wings.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.040
Thank you.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.710
But right now I'm enjoying work
more than anything.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.880
I figured you would say that.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.550
Your rehearsals for "The Red Leaf Ogre"
will get grueling tomorrow,

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.970
so today's your last day to relax for a while.
What do you want to do?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.140
Put! Me! Down!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.060
You insatiable angel!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.230
I just came here to drink wine!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.310
Damn you! Just get the prosciutto out!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:19.690
Yes, I will later, but for now,
I'll have you, Takato.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.360
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.440
Don't talk about me like you're ordering a beer!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.910
I like you better than beer, Takato.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.740
Shut up!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.290
Chunta.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.870
Takato, call me "Chunta" more.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.630
<i>Don't look at me like that.</i>

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.090
<i>When I didn't even know where you
were looking before.</i>

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.590
ONE YEAR AGO

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:44.550
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.640
I'm Junta Azumaya from Mitsuya Production.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.060
<i>Junta Azumaya?</i>

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.850
<i>At first glance, he passes muster.</i>

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.060
<i>But my eyes are not so merciful.</i>

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.730
<i>His face... half-Japanese?</i>

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.900
<i>Prominent features, but refined.</i>

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.740
<i>His body... Hey, how tall is he?</i>

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.740
<i>And he's got an irritatingly good body figure.</i>

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.870
<i>And his presence?</i>

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.330
<i>Ugh, turn that damn aura down.</i>

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.330
I look forward to working with you.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.580
Yeah.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.290
<i>Aggregate rating: High quality.</i>

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.930
<i>I don't know why he entered this business,</i>

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.640
<i>but he has those eyes
that don't know where they're looking.</i>

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.310
Mr. Saijo, I wonder what it is that I want?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:43.730
<i>Talent without the desire to drive it
is like an unused treasure.</i>

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.400
<i>That's right.</i>

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.280
<i>There's no way I could ever lose
to this half-hearted guy.</i>

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.410
<i>Come at me. I'll challenge you.</i>

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:56.120
<i>I'll challenge you as an actor, as the Sexiest Man
of the Year, all of it, and you'll never get—</i>

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:00.750
Hey.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.380
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.050
<i>He had these eyes?</i>

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.380
Azu... maya.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.180
<i>H-He's going to eat me.</i>

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.760
Saijo! Azumaya!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.180
Are you okay?

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.140
Here, towels!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.560
I'm not that wet,
so please take care of Azumaya.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.150
Sorry. But thanks.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:25.360
Not at all.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.450
I'm going to get some rest in the location bus
until we're ready.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.460
Th-That was terrifying.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.340
<i>No way. I was overpowered?</i>

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.500
<i>I won't accept it.</i>

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.590
<i>I won't accept it!</i>

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.970
<i>Hello? Oh, Takato?</i>

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.550
M-Mr. Sasaki.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.720
Please accept all of the jobs
that are currently on hold.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.730
No, no. It's okay.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.640
Cram it all in.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.060
I'll be fine. Thank you.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.480
<i>I'm the one who's better.</i>

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.610
<i>As an actor and as a man.</i>

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.530
<i>My fever isn't going down.</i>

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.790
<i>In fact, is it getting worse?</i>

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.200
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.670
<i>Slap on a cooling gel sheet, get some glucose,</i>

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:27.760
<i>chug a 4,000-yen energy drink,
get fired up again, and it'll work out!</i>

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:33.890
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.890
<i>I can perform normally.</i>

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.770
Mr. Saijo, are you not feeling well?

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.280
<i>I think my nail hit him, too.</i>

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.910
Why are you the one who realized it? Damn it.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.620
<i>It's frustrating.</i>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.120
<i>His star power keeps getting brighter.</i>

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.460
<i>There are times when even I'm drawn to him.</i>

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.960
<i>What'll happen if I lose?</i>

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.720
<i>I kind of feel like I'm going to fall.</i>

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.800
<i>My body is heavy.</i>

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.430
<i>I'm staggering.</i>

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.270
<i>Damn it.
I need to stand up straight.</i>

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.560
<i>Huh... What?</i>

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.480
<i>It feels warm.</i>

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.020
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:32.280
<i>Mr. Saijo, I've fallen in love with you.</i>

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.110
<i>Who...</i>

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.910
<i>I'm sorry. Even if you hate me...</i>

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.120
<i>Who was that?</i>

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.290
Can I keep liking you?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.460
Chunta?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.000
Takato?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.500
It couldn't be... You...

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.300
<i>No, that was a dream.</i>

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.640
<i>I thought it was a dream.
Don't tell me it was him?</i>

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.600
Wh-Whoa, whoa, whoa! Time out!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.930
What's wrong, Takato?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.730
O-Oh, um...

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.940
Hey, w-wait, wait, Chunta.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.990
<i>Hold on a second.</i>

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.610
<i>There's something wrong with my heart.</i>

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.160
Huh? Is your heart beating fast, Takato?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.200
No, you... I bet yours is, too!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.120
Let go of me!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:28.460
It is. My heart has always been
beating fast for you, Takato.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.130
You probably didn't know that.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.510
<i>Yeah, I didn't know, you idiot.</i>

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.100
Takato, show me your face.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:45.640
Takato, who do you belong to?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.060
Don't run away, and look at me.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.900
<i>I couldn't run away if I tried.</i>

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.770
<i>There is no path of escape.</i>

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.110
<i>Now that I think about it,
maybe this was inevitable.</i>

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:57.910
<i>That day...</i>

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.990
<i>ever since I looked into those eyes...</i>

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:04.660
<i>or maybe from the very beginning.</i>

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.750
You felt that more than usual, huh?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.550
Will you show me one more time?

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.670
Forget it! I can't!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.630
In fact, until "The Red Leaf Ogre" is over,
you're forbidden from touching me!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.430
And you have a drama series to shoot!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.720
Your costar is the famous Yurie Kurokawa.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.720
Focus on your work!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.350
But...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.190
Working on the stage takes stamina.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.310
Let me conserve my strength. All right?

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.280
Okay. Roger that.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.280
I'm exhausted! I sleep now!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.030
<i>This is no time to spread my wings.</i>

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>I need to focus on work.</i>

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.160
Former Stage Actress
Suzuko Saijo

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.960
Suzuko, I'm going to be in a play.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:53.750
This one.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.420
And who's your costar?

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.260
Kozaburo Nakata.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.300
That's hilarious.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.060
Don't let him steal the show.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.850
I'll steal the show from that ill-natured old fart!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.980
You'll see, Suzuko!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.440
Show me what you've got.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.030
Your acting style is quite grounded.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.860
That's not necessarily a bad thing.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.950
But when your heart
goes hand-in-hand with your acting...

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.040
I'm sure you'll soar.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.500
I haven't dreamed about Suzuko
for a long time.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.470
CHUNTA

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.850
<i>Good morning, Takato!</i>

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:49.060
Oh. I told you I don't need
a wake-up call every morning.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:52.100
<i>This is a call to hear your voice
right after waking up.</i>

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.480
<i>Has something happened?</i>

00:11:56.070 --> 00:12:00.190
Never mind me. You have
an important scene to shoot today, don't you?

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.650
You'd better focus.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.280
<i>Right. You, too, Takato.</i>

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.490
<i>Good luck with the premiere
of "The Red Leaf Ogre." Talk to you later.</i>

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.200
I'm surprised he could tell just by my voice.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.540
Even though we haven't
seen each other in a while.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.540
Forbidden to touch, huh?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.760
Concentrate on work!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:30.770
THE RED LEAF OGRE

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:27.560
<i>Suzuko diligently went and watched
all of my stage performances.</i>

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.770
<i>That's why I feel it even now.</i>

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.940
Mr. Usaka!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.980
So you're back home, huh?

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.030
TV-J General Producer
Kazuomi Usaka

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.030
Business is booming, eh?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.070
Thanks to you. The show sold out in minutes.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.990
With that lineup of staff and cast,
it's no wonder people want to see it.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.910
But they won't be satisfied unless
the performances exceed their expectations.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.370
Yes, that's what Takato said, too.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.580
I'll be watching carefully.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.380
Yes, please do.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:08.100
Mr. Saijo, you were
just thinking about him, weren't you?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.760
Japan Arts Enterprise
Chihiro Ayagi

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.470
I-I certainly was not thinking
about that sparkly insatiable angel!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.100
What's wrong?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:20.860
Nothing. Normally, this is where
that malicious angel would suddenly appear.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.530
He's not coming. I told him not to.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:25.110
You mean...

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.910
The curtain's going up. Focus.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.120
I know.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.000
<i>Focus.</i>

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:45.970
A flute?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.220
A robe made of red leaves.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.390
Don't tell me. The ogress, Kureha?!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:14:00.610
Oh? Wasn't that ogress' head hunted down
and chopped off ages ago? By humans?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.860
Are you a man?! Who are you?!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.360
This is the Hidden Door.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.910
So of course I must be an ogre, yes?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.370
Please stand back, Lord Shigesada!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.660
We shall handle this!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.630
Stand down, you two!
As I said, we didn't come here to fight.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.750
Hey! I just came here to talk!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:29.050
Talk? What do humans have to say
as they attack an ogre?

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:37.310
<i>Why do I catch glimpses of his face even here?</i>

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.310
You want this blood, don't you?

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.690
You can't resist your instinct.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.490
Come then, Shigesada.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.330
That's it, Shigesada.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:58.000
When you come to your senses,
Kureha's earnest wish will come true.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.790
We'll be able to destroy the capital
and build our world!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.130
Shigesada?!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.600
<i>It's not that I can't focus.</i>

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.020
<i>In fact, more than usual...</i>

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.980
Shigesada is to become
the leader of the Hidden Door?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:22.810
Yes.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.770
But I haven't carried out my mission yet.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.070
I'm the leader of the Hidden Door!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.160
I have to destroy the capital
and build the ogre world.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:36.120
Not with human hands, but with ogre hands.
That was Lady Kureha's dying wish.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:41.120
Then why am I here, at the Hidden Door?
Why have I...

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:47.630
Shigesada? Was I just a pawn
to awaken Shigesada's abilities?

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.050
You have fulfilled your role.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.050
I can become neither ogre nor human.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.470
Where do I belong?

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.140
<i>Tsunewaka's feelings
have penetrated deep in my mind.</i>

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.480
<i>What is this sensation?</i>

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.030
Mother.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.750
Mr. Saijo, are you okay?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.170
Maybe you threw yourself too exuberantly?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.710
If you don't save your energy, you'll—

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:28.210
You better not be saving your energy.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.710
Try to steal the show from me, Shigesada.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.640
<i>This isn't like me.</i>

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:41.020
<i>Takato Saijo is a cool actor
who plays it by the book.</i>

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.480
<i>I calculate the role and where I stand,</i>

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.900
<i>then perfectly control the play
with my acting ability and sense of balance.</i>

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.070
That's right. We're ogres.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.190
Ogres that kill and devour humans!

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.450
<i>But then why...</i>

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.990
Turn the capital into the color of red leaves!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.490
<i>Why do I have this burning feeling in my chest?</i>

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.830
<i>Why?</i>

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:10.840
Shigesada, my little brother,

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.800
we have a cursed fate.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.140
I'll cut it down with Little Crow here!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.030
<i>It's beautiful.</i>

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.070
<i>Propelling me from the bottom of my heart...</i>

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:40.120
<i>Passion welling up inside me...</i>

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:41.870
<i>When did it start?</i>

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.080
<i>Chunta.</i>

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.500
<i>You always threaten me.</i>

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.760
<i>You stole the title
of Sexiest Man of the Year from me.</i>

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.550
<i>You stole a lead role from me, and then...</i>

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>you stole my heart.</i>

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.850
<i>Chunta.</i>

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.150
<i>Chunta!</i>

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.490
<i>If I have you, then I could...</i>

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.060
<i>It's so bright.</i>

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.350
<i>I want to see him.</i>

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.820
Mr. Saijo, you were a wonderful Tsunewaka!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.570
I had goose pimples!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.660
Takato, I have just one word for you.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:02.530
Theater Company
"Southern News Agency"
Theater Director
Kazuki Kitano

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.530
Bravo!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:08.500
Chihi, you did better than I imagined, too.
That was a great performance.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.080
How was your first performance
on the stage with Takato?

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.800
Well, Mr. Saijo is seriously incredible.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.260
Ow!

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.970
You did good, Ayagi.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.260
You gave a nice, passionate performance.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.890
I know I can do a lot better.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.970
I'll show you next time.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.890
Show me what you've got.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:36.730
It looks like "The Red Leaf Ogre"
will be your next major representative work.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:37.820
Mr. Sasaki.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.450
Yes?

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:43.160
A while ago, I was taken to the hospital, right?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.660
The person who carried me there, um...

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.160
Takato...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.250
You want to know who it was? Do you?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.580
I've wanted to tell you all this time!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.290
I can finally say it!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.590
N-Never mind.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.550
Don't be like that! Ask me!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.760
Hello? Oh, Azumaya! Good evening.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.970
You're here to abduct him?

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.600
I see. As always, you're right on time.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.680
Well, please take good care of—

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.940
So you do mean to abduct me!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.440
You criminal angel!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.280
Good work today, Takato.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.280
Why are you here?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.280
You're forbidden to touch me.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:31.790
Still, I wanted to see you and say,
"Good work," on the night of your premiere.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.790
I wanted to see the premiere
of "The Red Leaf Ogre,"

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.420
because I can only see
"opening night" Takato on opening night.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.010
It's a little frustrating that I didn't.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.050
The last showing.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.850
I'll reserve you a seat.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:49.060
So until then, stay fired up for your drama.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.430
If you cut any corners with your performance,
I won't forgive you.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:54.900
Okay!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.230
I'll give you a ride.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:03.490
<i>Can I keep liking you?</i>

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.490
<i>I wasn't able to answer him.</i>

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:09.240
<i>Well, I can answer him someday, if I feel like it.</i>

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.620
<i>That "someday" is now.</i>

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.550
Takato? Is something wrong?

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.010
I-It's nothing!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.260
Takato, wait!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.890
Get away from me!

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.690
Hey, what's with this hand?

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:03.900
Oh, it moved by itself.

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:06.570
I told you, touching is off-limits.

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:08.360
Kissing is okay, right?

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:10.360
No! It's bad for the heart!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:14.740
The heart?
You mean I make yours go pitter-pat?

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:17.290
Dummy! Don't get carried away!

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.170
Independent
Photographer
Jiro Hasegawa

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.670
I guess you two are close.

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:29.840
I've made up my mind
about a lot of things here,

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:33.220
about work, about my feelings for Takato.

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:35.470
I've made up my mind, too.

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.730
hug 10
"We're breaking up, Chunta."
